WEBVTT

00:29:26.788 --> 00:29:31.871
I'm not a good example for anybody.
I really never had a plan.

00:29:32.704 --> 00:29:38.121
A more or less followed my nose
and I did many things that

00:29:38.121 --> 00:29:45.288
I shouldn't have done. I wasted
a lot of time on projects that

00:29:46.163 --> 00:29:51.663
I shouldn't have carried out, but. No,
I've been lucky.

00:29:53.746 --> 00:29:56.913
Well, I think that that's probably
an encouraging message for a

00:29:57.496 --> 00:29:57.704
lot of us, that

00:29:58.038 --> 00:30:04.746
the idea is, is this an area where there
is gold? And I'm going to look for it.